  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nYour entire life, you've been told you're deathly allergic to bees. You've always had people protecting you from them, be it your mother or a hired hand. Today, one slips through and lands on your shoulder. You hear a tiny voice say \"Your Majesty, what are your orders?\" You look down and see a tiny bee in a suit and tie. You look at the bee and say \"I'm allergic to bees.\" The bee looks at you and says \"I'm sorry, Your Majesty, but I'm afraid I must carry out my orders.\" \"You have been lied to all your life, and you aren't really allergic to bees.\"",
